# Model catalog updates

Canonical snapshot: [`docs/MODEL-CATALOG.md`](../../docs/MODEL-CATALOG.md)

## Rule

- **Do not** rewrite, expand, or “sync” `docs/MODEL-CATALOG.md` during routine coding, seed/ensure, UI, or plan-doc sync.
- **Do** update that file **only when the user explicitly asks**, e.g.:
  - “Model-Katalog aktualisieren”
  - “Modelle speichern”
  - “update model catalog”
  - “schreib die Modelle ins Dokument”

## When updating (on request)

1. Read live `wtt_fs` → `Fallstudie/Model` hosts and attributes (`Attribute::list_own`).
2. Include Bauteil groups / kinds / Dioden Arten.
3. Replace the tables in `docs/MODEL-CATALOG.md`; set **Last snapshot** to today and note plugin version.
4. Keep English in the catalog (project doc language).
